<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN" data-site-prefix="../" data-page-kind="topic"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>全景架构 · 架构逆向与实现对照文档</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/542ae2d5e2de76f7a482e81bed7afe56395d5076e55bb540bec24f2862bef6e9.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/site.css"></head><body><a class="site-skip" href="#main-content">跳到正文</a><header class="site-header"><nav aria-label="主导航"><a href="../index.html">首页／界面入口</a><a href="../主题/主界面入口.html">主界面</a><a href="../工具/index.html">工具窗口</a><a href="../数据/index.html">数据与 Owner</a><a href="../主题/执行与状态.html">执行与结果</a><a href="../清单/交付与兼容.html">范围／兼容</a></nav><p class="breadcrumb">架构逆向与实现对照文档 / 全景架构</p><h1>全景架构</h1><p class="muted">原版事实、当前独立实现、拟议设计与未知分别保留。导航示意属于文档组织，不代表原程序的控件树或完整运行验证。</p><p id="route-message" role="status" hidden></p></header><main id="main-content" class="site-main"><div class="source-content"><section class="view active" id="overview"><p class="intro">同一列是相似的责任层，<strong>不是</strong>原版与当前实现一一同构。原版通过平台 SDK 和原生模块执行；当前版以独立托管模型和执行器运行。两条链必须逐边对账。</p><div class="layout"><div class="surface"><h2>先从主界面进入</h2><small>这是入口区域索引示意，不是原版截图或像素级布局。点击区域查看关联架构节点。</small><div class="windowmap" id="visible-entry-map"><h3>主界面入口地图 · 点击位置直接查看对应分析</h3><div id="menu-map-root" data-menu-map-host data-menu-detail="inspector" data-menu-prefix="architecture-recovery/"></div><h4>按分析主题快速查看（以下9项是研究分组）</h4><div class="entry-toolbar"><a class="wregion" href="../../入口/startup.html">启动/恢复</a><a class="wregion" href="../../入口/solution.html">方案配置</a><a class="wregion" href="../../入口/save.html">保存</a><a class="wregion" href="../../入口/run.html">单次运行</a><a class="wregion" href="../../入口/continuous.html">全部连续</a><a class="wregion" href="../../入口/stop.html">停止</a><a class="wregion" href="../../入口/variables.html">变量</a><a class="wregion" href="../../入口/camera.html">相机</a><a class="wregion" href="../../入口/communication.html">通信</a></div><div class="entry-layout"><